♪ <i>The admission's free </i>♪♪

99
00:05:17.291 --> 00:05:19.541
<i>Channing is my oldest.</i>

100
00:05:19.625 --> 00:05:23.291
<i>She, her husband Doug and their twins,
Lucy and Ben,</i>

101
00:05:23.375 --> 00:05:26.750
<i>live just a few hours away in Austin.</i>

102
00:05:26.833 --> 00:05:30.416
<i>Makes me so happy to have her close by.</i>

103
00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:35.833
<i>She's her own woman now, but I still make
an extra stop at Schultz's every year</i>

104
00:05:35.916 --> 00:05:37.625
<i>just so she can have her pfeffernuss.</i>

105
00:05:37.708 --> 00:05:40.125
- Hello!
<i>- She loves pfeffernuss.</i>

106
00:05:40.208 --> 00:05:41.541
Hello!

107
00:05:41.625 --> 00:05:43.875
Mom?

108
00:05:43.958 --> 00:05:45.541
- The Christmas tree!
- Dad?

109
00:05:45.625 --> 00:05:47.208
- So cool.
- Ding-dong.

110
00:05:47.291 --> 00:05:50.458
She hasn't gotten rid of
a single decoration since we were kids.

111
00:05:50.541 --> 00:05:51.750
That one's mine.

112
00:05:51.833 --> 00:05:53.375
Hey, don't touch the presents.

113
00:05:53.458 --> 00:05:54.833
Mom?

114
00:05:54.916 --> 00:05:56.291
- I'm here!
- Hi, Mom.

115
00:05:56.375 --> 00:05:57.625
Hello!

116
00:05:57.708 --> 00:05:59.041
- Grandmama Claire!
- Come here!

117
00:05:59.125 --> 00:06:00.541
I have missed you two so much.

118
00:06:00.625 --> 00:06:02.833
Hey, I thought I heard voices.

119
00:06:02.916 --> 00:06:04.625
- Little Bean!
- Oh, hey, Dad!

120
00:06:04.708 --> 00:06:06.083
