129
00:06:21.875 --> 00:06:24.750
the, uh... <i>So You're a Dancer, </i>have you?

130
00:06:24.833 --> 00:06:26.273
- It's our favorite show.
- I got it.

131
00:06:27.666 --> 00:06:29.059
- Here we go. Come on.
- I am so relieved,

132
00:06:29.083 --> 00:06:30.416
because I have been wondering...

133
00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:35.625
