151
00:07:24.916 --> 00:07:26.458
That's so creepy.

152
00:07:26.541 --> 00:07:28.208
Yeah. Sneaky is creepy.

153
00:07:29.583 --> 00:07:31.708
Okay. Go, go, go, go, go!

154
00:07:31.791 --> 00:07:32.934
- He's hidden very well.
- Come on, guys, let's check downstairs

155
00:07:32.958 --> 00:07:34.059
