171
00:08:05.166 --> 00:08:08.833
<i>My little girl, weight of the world
on her shoulders.</i>

172
00:08:08.916 --> 00:08:12.333
Things are a little unhinged right now
with the...

173
00:08:12.416 --> 00:08:14.875
