940
00:47:01.291 --> 00:47:02.375
Right.

941
00:47:02.458 --> 00:47:03.666
<i>Ladies and gentlemen,</i>

942
00:47:03.750 --> 00:47:05.870
<i>- please welcome the </i>So You're a Dancer...
- Okay. Okay.

943
00:47:05.916 --> 00:47:07.583
<i>Holiday Tour.</i>

944
00:47:24.625 --> 00:47:26.458
Damn, Santa's jacked.

945
00:47:37.583 --> 00:47:38.958
Where's Mom?

946
00:47:39.041 --> 00:47:41.166
Uh, Taylor said
you were with her.

947
00:47:41.250 --> 00:47:42.541
No, it wasn't her.

948
00:47:42.625 --> 00:47:44.041
- Oh.
- Where is she?

949
00:47:44.125 --> 00:47:45.976
- I don't know. So...
- What do you mean you don't know?

950
00:47:46.000 --> 00:47:48.000
Well, she was, she was in your car, right?

951
00:47:48.083 --> 00:47:49.809
