- ♪ <i>Merry, merry</i> ♪
- ♪ <i>Ho!</i> ♪

1927
01:40:58.000 --> 01:40:59.416
- ♪ <i>Very, very</i> ♪
- ♪ <i>Ho!</i> ♪

1928
