♪ <i>Very merry Christmas </i>♪♪

1932
01:41:16.250 --> 01:41:22.291
♪ <i>I heard the bells on Christmas Day </i> ♪

1933
01:41:22.375 --> 01:41:28.916
♪ <i>Their old familiar carols play </i> ♪

1934
01:41:29.000 --> 01:41:35.041
♪ <i>and wild and sweet the words repeat </i> ♪

1935
01:41:35.125 --> 01:41:38.000
♪ <i>of peace on Earth </i> ♪

1936
